{"articleNo":"242350","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=242350&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] 금오공대(온라인)갤러리 <9월 정광화 (온라인)초대전> 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.09.14","hit":"6947","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img width=\"804\" height=\"638\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"width: 804px; height: 638px; clear: none; float: none;\" src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBlHoQTnBBAvAEgSwO4CtkAcsFMAyAxgG4CS+AYugOoCyAmgHTpYDmQA%20\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">월</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"> 1일부터 전시 중인 <strong>&lt;정광화 초대전 - 기호와 상징의 절대평면&gt;</strong>을 온라인 영상 콘텐츠로 공개합니다. </span></font></span></span></font></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><font color=\"#333333\"></font></p><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">○</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\"> 내용 : 작가 소개, 갤러리 전시 풍경, 전시 대표 작품 소개 등 (러닝타임 : 3분 59초)</span></font></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">(영상촬영 및 편집 : 금오공대교육방송국(KOBS))</span></font></span></span></span></font></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 53, 53);\"><br></span></span></p></font></span></span></font><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">관람 방법 : 금오공대 강의지원시스템 - &lt;공개강의(OCW)&gt; - &lt;금오공대(온라인)갤러리&gt; - &lt;9월 정광화 (온라인)초대전&gt;&nbsp;을 통해 관람 가능</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 98%;\">학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">, </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 98%;\">교직원은 원스톱 아이디</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕;\">/</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-font-width: 98%;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">패스워드로 로그인 가능합니다. </span></span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221);\"><a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"http://ocw.kumoh.ac.kr/Main.do?cmd=viewHome\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></a></span><a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"http://ocw.kumoh.ac.kr/Main.do?cmd=viewHome\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 221);\"><u><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif;\">☞ 금오공대 강의지원시스템 - &lt;공개강의&gt; 바로가기 (클릭!)</span></u></span></a></p><p><br></p><p><font face=\"Arial\"><br></font></p><table width=\"1036\" class=\"txc-table\" style=\"border: currentColor; border-image: none; width: 1036px; height: 118px; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 16px; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); border-image: none; width: 874px; height: 117px;\"><p><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; ※ 현재, 전시 중인 <span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">&lt;9월 정광화 초대전&gt; 오프라인&nbsp;전시관람</span>은 <span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">사회적거리두기를 실천하며 관람 가능</span>합니다. </span></font></p><p><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 운영시간 : 월~금 10:00~18:00(토, 일요일 및 공휴일 휴관)</span></font></p><p><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 장소 : 학생회관 B1(서점 바로 옆!)</span></font></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><font face=\"Arial\"><font face=\"Arial\"><br></font></font></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><font face=\"Arial\"></font></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;\"><font face=\"Arial\"><font face=\"Ar